  "bodyHash": "a7513424a6b4518d",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《變異怪物》將《我的世界》的生物提升至令人膽寒的全新境界！與各種標誌性生物的變異體展開激戰，它們各自擁有毀滅性的力量與獨特的獎勵。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擊敗變異殭屍、變異骷髏、變異苦力怕、變異終界使者等，每個都帶來嶄新的挑戰。打造強力道具、馴服爆炸僕從，並發現如「蜘蛛豬」等奇特新生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">準備好迎接史詩級的戰鬥與傳說級的戰利品吧！在這個生存無法保證的世界裡，展開你的冒險。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 特色變異生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：體型龐大的蠻牛，擁有強力的砸擊攻擊。擊敗牠即可獲得強大的<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克鎚</span></strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異骷髏</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：致命的神射手。擊敗牠後可用其骨骼製作<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異骷髏盔甲</span></strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：以連鎖爆炸造成巨大破壞。死亡時會掉落<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異終界使者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：令人畏懼的瞬移殺手。斬斷牠的手部即可透過<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界靈魂之手</span></strong>獲得其力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異雪人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：強大的盟友，會向敵人投擲巨大的冰塊。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👾 僕從與夥伴</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：由<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong>孵化出的爆炸夥伴。使用<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong>進行馴服與追蹤。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蜘蛛豬</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一種快速且難以預測的生物，是將<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化學X</span></strong>注入吃下發酵蜘蛛眼的豬後所創造出來的。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 特殊道具</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化學X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一種神秘的液體，能將生物變異為強大的變異體或奇特的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浩克鎚</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一把威力強大的武器，砸向地面時可將敵人擊退。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界靈魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：獲得來自變異終界使者的瞬移與方塊操控能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：一種有毒武器，用於地形上會引發爆炸。透過摧毀<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從蛋</span></strong>獲得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕僕從追蹤器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：用於追蹤與控制你的苦力怕僕從的裝置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異骷髏盔甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">變異骷髏骨頭</span></strong>打造強力盔甲。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器皆須安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援設定功能，可直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行調整（Fabric 版本需安裝 Prospector 開發的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a>）。請注意，在較舊的《我的世界》版本中，也必須安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a>才能使用設定畫面。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於<code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code>資料夾內，檔名依設定類型分別為<code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code>或<code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非所有模組都會包含全部類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shcott21</span></a>，早在多年前他就以<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《變異生物》</span></a>的名稱最初發布了本模組。絕大部分的工作，尤其是那些驚人的模型，都是由他一手完成的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Chumbanotz</span></a>，他是首位將變異生物帶入現代《我的世界》的創作者，透過其<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《變異野獸》</span></a>模組為此次最終復刻奠定了基礎。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感謝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">tdstress</span></a>全面更新了模組中的所有貼圖，使其完美契合新版《我的世界》的美術風格！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ytones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
